 that gave us warmth.",3,""],["w",0.35],["bg","story_main_01_023_a",0,0.8],["w",0.6],["say","avg1_143","But a few years ago... The Monolith went dark. The people here had no choice but to abandon the city.",3,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.35],["se","se_169"],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.9],["w",0.9],["film",1],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["bg","north_street_grey_night",0,0.0],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg1_143","a","002",null,-0.25,1.3,0,null,null],["w",0.35],["trn",1,1,false,false,0.9],["w",0.75],["mrt",2,"y","012","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","I'm sorry. I didn't mean to drag up bad memories.",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m57"],["ctl","avg1_143","a","005","music",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","Don't be. Northerners are tougher than you think. We may have left, but we'll rebuild somewhere else.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"z","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Is this your first time back?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_143","Yes. When the Monolith went dark, we fled in haste and never returned.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_143","a","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","I swore an oath. I have to stop that tragedy from happening again ... and find out what happened with the Monolith.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_143","a","004","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","My grandfather backed my decision. So, with that resolve, I traveled to the City of a Thousand Monoliths alone.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","009","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.35],["say","avg1_143","Later, I joined the Sentinel of Dawn and learned about Nocturn Eterna—fanatics destroying Monoliths everywhere.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"y","020","speechless",null],["say","avg3_100","... I see. No wonder you're so fixated on them.",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","021","shy",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","Speaking of which, I shouldn't have suspected you back in the carriage. I'm sorry.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"z","007","flurry",null],["say","avg3_100","Suspected me? Why...?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-40.0,1.2,"OutCubic",0.65,null,null,null],["w",0.25],["show","avg1_142","a","002",0.25,-0.3,1.4,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_142","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.7,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg1_142","a",null,null,null,-0.15,null,null,null,"OutSine",6.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","015","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","In the City of a Thousand Monoliths, I spotted a Nocturn Eterna tailing you.==W== I assumed you were their insider.",0,""],["w",0.7],["ctl","avg1_142","a","010",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","014","shy",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.35],["goon"],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_142","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["hide","avg1_142",0.5],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_143","a","010","love",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["say","avg1_143","But after watching you for a while, I realized I was wrong. Let's just call it a misunderstanding.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"z","007","symbol",null],["tsk","Xiao"],["say","avg3_100","Huh? A Nocturn Eterna was tailing me...? Did you get a good look at them?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","012","speechless",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["bgm",""],["say","avg1_143","Hm...?",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,0.35,-0.325,1.45,0.0,null,"OutQuad",0.45],["cbg",0,-250.0,null,1.15,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_090"],["bg","BG_Black",5,0.0],["show","avg1_1211","a","019",null,-0.59,1.7,5,null,null],["w",0.45],["stage",5,0,14],["w",0.3],["fx",5,"fx_avg_flash_light",0,0],["w",1.3],["stage",5,1,15],["w",0.25],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["w",0.1],["se","se_062"],["ctl","avg1_143","a","019",null,0.5,-0.25,1.3,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.6],["w",0.3],["mrt",2,"z","002","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Wraith, what's wrong?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm","m46"],["ctl","avg1_143","a","013","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_143","Ah, sorry, I was just thinking...==W== I don't think I actually saw her face.",0,""],["w",0.65],["ctl","avg1_143","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_143","a","006","exclamation",null,null,null,null,"jushou","OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["say","avg1_143","She wasn't carrying any weapons, so I can't recall the specifics... But her pale skin, characteristic of the Bayan, and the white, pointed horns atop her head were proof enough that she was a member of Nocturn Eterna.",0,""],["w",0.35],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["show","avg1_106","a","005",null,-0.2,1.3,0,null,null],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.5],["w",0.1],["mrt",1,"y","020","think",null],["say","avg3_100","Nocturn Eterna traits... Aeloria's skin is pale, sure, but she doesn't have white horns...",2,""],["bgm",""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,0.6],["w",0.6],["ctl","avg1_106","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["hide","avg1_106",0],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["bg","north_street_grey_night",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,null,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.6],["w",0.3],["ctl","avg1_143","a","005","star",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","It doesn't matter. Even if they do show up, I can handle them.",0,""],["bgm","m33"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","004","attention",null,null,null,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","Instead of fearing unseen enemies, better get a good night's sleep now and prepare for tomorrow. Come on, let's head back to our room.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"z","002","shock",null],["say","avg3_100","You're right. It's freezing out here. Let's go—quietly, so we don't wake the others.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["bgm",""],["w",0.6],["se","se_148"],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.7],["w",0.7],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","north_street_grey_night_nolight",0,0.0],["cbg",0,-100.0,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.25],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.7],["bgm",""],["cbg",0,150.0,null,null,"Linear",15.0,null,null,null],["se","se_474"],["show","avg1_143","a","010",0.6,-0.33,1.4,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,0.4,null,null,null,null,"Linear",15.0],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_143","No problem. I'm a pro at this.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"z","014","music",null],["say","avg3_100","Hm? Could it be... You always sneak into people's rooms while they're asleep?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","007",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_143","Heh, that's a nice one. But no. I used to sneak into the hunting grounds at night for archery practice.",0,""],["say","avg1_143","Usually wouldn't make it back till around now.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_143","a","021","shy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg1_143","Ran into a real monster once. Scared me stiff. I couldn't even pull the trigger.",0,""],["w",0.5],["mrt",1,"y","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Then what? How'd you get out of there alive?",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","002","exclamation",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","A passing girl saved my skin. Her magic was insane. Dropped the beast in a single shot.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_143","a","003","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","I never saw her again, though. I asked around everywhere, but nobody knew a thing.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_143","a","013","vexation",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","Most folks back home rely on steel. You'd think a mage would stand out.",0,""],["w",0.35],["stg",0,250.0,-20.0,1.15,"OutCubic",0.7,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_143","a","011",null,null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","If I ever run into her again, I just want to thank her properly.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",1,"z","012","question",null],["say","avg3_100","Wraith... Did you sneak out tonight hoping you'd bump into her, at this hour like you did back then?",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","021","sweaty",null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","Heh. I'm not that sentimental.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_143","a","004",null,0.55,null,null,null,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["w",0.3],["se","se_228"],["obj","qstory_event_04_002",1,0.35,0.54],["w",0.4],["say","avg1_143","Was actually looking for something to polish this,==W== but all I dug up were some grimy rags.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_143","a","016","sigh",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.3],["w",0.3],["goon"],["say","0","Wraith pulls out the badge I noticed earlier.",0,""],["w",0.35],["ctl","avg1_143","a","015","shy",null,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","I've had this on me since I left home. But the humidity down south is no joke. It's in pretty rough shape now.",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"z","014","idea",null],["bgm",""],["say","avg3_100","Oh... I've got an idea. Have the perfect thing for that.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.65],["se","se_076"],["trn",0,3,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","city_room_inside_night_winter",0,0.0],["objx"],["w",0.35],["trn",1,3,false,false,1.0],["w",0.45],["obj","qstory_event_04_001",1,null,0.54],["se","se_084"],["fx",0,"fx_avg_congr",0,1],["w",0.65],["mrt",2,"z","013",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Here.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["obj","qstory_event_04_001",1,0.35,0.54],["w",0.15],["bgm","m32"],["show","avg1_143","b","012",0.65,-0.17,1.2,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_143","b",null,"question",null,-0.29,1.35,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.45],["w",0.45],["say","avg1_143","Isn't that the \"drink\" you pulled out on the carriage?",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"z","014","star",null],["say","avg3_100","... Just trust me. It'll strip the rust right off.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["trn",0,1,true,true,0.7],["w",0.45],["se","se_382"],["w",0.35],["obj","qstory_event_04_003",1,null,0.54],["w",0.75],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["w",0.7],["fx",0,"fx_avg_bubble",0,1],["w",1.55],["bgm",""],["mrt",2,"z","013","flower",null],["say","avg3_100","And... Done! Look, rust is completely gone.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["obj","qstory_event_04_003",1,0.35,0.54],["cbg",0,100.0,null,null,"OutCubic",0.6,null,null,null],["show","avg1_143","b","007",0.78,-0.29,1.32,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_143","b",null,"star",0.65,null,null,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.6],["w",0.6],["say","avg1_143","Woah...! It looks exactly like it used to!==W== What kind of Artifact is this?!",0,""],["w",0.75],["objx"],["ctl","avg1_143","b","021","attention",0.51,-0.43,1.55,null,"daintou","OutSine",0.55],["w",0.55],["goon"],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"z","014","music",null],["say","avg3_100","Rust remover. Rare, but handy! A member of my guild wishes this stuff up all the time.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["se","se_070"],["stg",0,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0,null,null,"Zhong"],["ctl","avg1_143","b","020",null,null,null,null,null,"chijing","OutSine",0.5],["tsk","Zhong"],["say","avg1_143","But if it's that precious, are you sure you want to waste it on this...?",0,""],["w",0.35],["mrt",2,"z","023",null,null],["say","avg3_100","Of course.==W== It means a lot to you, doesn't it?",1,""],["w",0.6],["mrt",0,"z","022","shock",null],["goon"],["ctl","avg1_143","b","012",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.3],["mrt",0,"y","024",null,null],["say","avg3_100","If my friends were standing here instead of me, I know they'd make the exact same choice.",1,""],["mrt",3,"y",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["bgm",""],["ctl","avg1_143","b","011","shy",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.35],["w",0.35],["say","avg1_143","Sounds like you have an amazing team...Thank you. I won't forget this favor.",0,""],["w",0.5],["clear",0,0,1],["w",0.55],["se","se_076"],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.9],["w",0.9],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.05,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","circle_light",0,0.0],["w",0.3],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.9],["w",0.9],["mrt",2,"z","002","attention",null],["say","avg3_100","Alright, time to say goodnight.",1,""],["mrt",3,"z",null,null,null],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.7,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.4],["show","avg1_143","b","011",null,-0.18,1.2,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_143","b",null,"flower",null,-0.34,1.4,1.0,null,"OutCubic",0.5],["w",0.5],["say","avg1_143","Yeah. Night. See you tomorrow.",0,""],["w",0.35],["se","se_060"],["ctl","avg1_143","a","007",null,0.38,null,null,null,null,"OutSine",1.5],["w",1],["ctl","avg1_143","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"OutSine",0.5],["w",0.1],["trn",0,0,true,true,1.0],["w",1.0],["stg",0,-180.0,null,1.1,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["bg","BG_Black",0,0.0],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",0.5],["se","se_187"],["w",0.5],["say","0","...==W== ...==W== ...",0,""],["w",0.7],["goon"],["w",0.7],["goon"],["w",0.35],["se","se_187_stop"],["w",0.05],["se","se_077"],["bg","city_room_inside_night_winter",0,0.7],["cbg",0,90.0,80